l":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/series/73749/episodes/5ea1c635e3cf8.jpg"},{"title":"Sacrificial Pawn: Emissary from the Divide","synopsis":"While researching the team's disappearance and John Smith, Togusa takes a calculated risk. The GHOST members question the true nature of their mission.","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/series/73749/episodes/5ea1c6c7daa37.jpg"},{"title":"Patrick Huge: Gift from God","synopsis":"Aramaki sets off after Kusanagi in a race against time. GHOST begin their assignment, but Huge's cybernetic security forces them to alter their plans.","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/series/73749/episodes/5ea1c76ad10f2.jpg"},{"title":"Disclosure: Quantized Gospel","synopsis":"Following the Section 9 reunion, Kusanagi and her colleagues learn about the \"post-humans,\" a previously unknown threat to humanity.","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/series/73749/episodes/5ea1c7d08a4b5.jpg"},{"title":"Pie in the Sky: First Bank Robbery","synopsis":"Back in Japan after six years, Batou decides to take a break while waiting for his delayed team. Then some amateur bank robbers interrupt his fun.","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/series/73749/episodes/5ea1c809cb945.jpg"},{"title":"Assemble: What Came About as a Result of Togusa`s Death","synopsis":"The Major and Smith clash over Section 9's new mission hunting post-humans. She orders Togusa to investigate a suspected spy near the Prime Minister.","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/series/73749/episodes/5ea1c832a9f19.jpg"},{"title":"Identity Theft: The Lonely Struggle","synopsis":"Problems arise for Section 9 after one of the three post-humans in Japan murders several politicians, then targets the Prime Minister's father-in-law.","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/series/73749/episodes/5ea1c880ba50e.jpg"},{"title":"Net People: Reasons Leading to Flameout","synopsis":"Section 9 investigates a possible post-human hacker who uses the web to incite physical attacks on people. The trail leads to a high school student.","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/series/73749/episodes/5ea1c90d8a51f.jpg"},{"title":"Edgelord: The Revolution of the 14-year-olds","synopsis":"Pudding helps analyze the Thinkpol program while the Major and Togusa search for clues about the post-human middle school student Takashi Shimamura.","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/series/73749/episodes/5ea1c96a768ca.jpg"},{"title":"Nostalgia: All Will Become N","synopsis":"Togusa has a strange episode while analyzing the data confiscated from Shimamura. When he wakes up, he and Batou head out to investigate.","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/series/73749/episodes/5ea1c9c7c7b24.jpg"}],"fields":{},"episodes":{}}
